# Procurement Opportunity Registry

A Cloudflare-hosted scanner and read-only registry for procurement Bidding Events.

- [Development plan](DEVELOPMENT_PLAN.md)
- [Domain language](CONTEXT.md)
- [Technical-area taxonomy](tech-area-classification.yaml)

## Local foundation preview

Requirements: Node.js 22 or later.

```bash
npm install
npm run db:migrate:local
npm run db:seed:local
npm run dev
```

The local seed contains clearly marked fixture data. Cloudflare Access is bypassed only for loopback requests and authenticated Amp development portals; other shared and production hostnames fail closed without `TEAM_DOMAIN` and `POLICY_AUD`. The Amp portal exception is removed from production builds.

## Checks

```bash
npm run validate:config
npm run typecheck
npm test
npm run build
```

`wrangler.jsonc` intentionally uses a local D1 identifier. Create and configure preview/production resources before deployment; no remote infrastructure is created by the local setup.
